+        <summary><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sum-head"><span class="sum-name">Upscale</span><span class="sum-say">UniverSR on Forge draws the top of the spectrum anew. Each run is a branch of the tree; its variants differ by the noise.</span></span></summary>
